---
// Flagship v1.0 highlight — Git for 3D Printing.
// Intentionally its own section between Hero and FeatureGrid so the
// concept gets billboard-level visibility, not a buried grid card.
//
// Uses the dark-theme tokens from global.css (--bg, --text, --accent)
// so it reads as a first-class section, not a retrofit.
---

<section class="g3d-section">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="g3d-inner">
      <div class="g3d-copy">
        <div class="g3d-badge">NEW in v1.0 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Patent-pending</div>
        <h2 class="g3d-heading">Git for 3D Printing</h2>
        <p class="g3d-lead">
          Branch new ideas without losing the working version. Merge what prints best.
          Sign a release and prove later that nothing changed.
        </p>
        <p class="g3d-sub">Works on three things you iterate on:</p>
        <ul class="g3d-list">
          <li><strong>Your designs</strong> &mdash; the mesh itself</li>
          <li><strong>Your decorations</strong> &mdash; logos, textures, photo-emboss, brand assets</li>
          <li><strong>Your features</strong> &mdash; reusable parts: a hat for an action figure, a mounting bracket, chamfers, fillets, pockets, holes</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="g3d-lead g3d-lead-small">
          On Pro and up. Local-first &mdash; branches, merges, and signed releases live on your machine. Pro adds cross-machine cloud sync; Business adds team pull requests and approval gates; Enterprise adds audit log export, SSO, and step-up authentication on production releases.
        </p>
        <div class="g3d-ctas">
          <a href="/install" class="btn g3d-btn-primary">Install and try it &rarr;</a>
          <a href="#features" class="btn btn-ghost g3d-btn-secondary">See all features</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="g3d-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="g3d-chat">
          <div class="g3d-chat-header">
            <div class="g3d-avatar">K</div>
            <div class="g3d-chat-title">
              <div class="g3d-chat-name">Kiln</div>
              <div class="g3d-chat-sub">via Claude &middot; 734 MCP tools</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="g3d-msg g3d-msg-user">
            <div class="g3d-bubble g3d-bubble-user">
              Branch my coaster, try three emboss depths, tell me which prints best, then sign the winner as v1.0.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="g3d-msg">
            <div class="g3d-bubble">
              <div class="g3d-bubble-text">
                On it. Running the flow:
              </div>
              <div class="g3d-toolchips">
                <span class="g3d-chip">create_design_branch &times;3</span>
                <span class="g3d-chip">apply_decoration &times;3</span>
                <span class="g3d-chip">start_print &times;3</span>
                <span class="g3d-chip">record_outcome &times;3</span>
                <span class="g3d-chip g3d-chip-win">best &rarr; emboss-2mm</span>
                <span class="g3d-chip">merge_branches</span>
                <span class="g3d-chip g3d-chip-sign">sign_release 1.0.0</span>
              </div>
              <div class="g3d-bubble-text g3d-bubble-result">
                <span class="g3d-ok">&#x2713;</span> Release <strong>1.0.0</strong> signed &middot; key <span class="g3d-mono">a3f9b2c1&hellip;</span>
                <br />
                <span class="g3d-muted">Any downstream party can verify later that the mesh hasn&rsquo;t changed.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .g3d-section {
    /* Match the global dark theme; lift the section with a subtle
       radial so it reads as its own beat without breaking the palette.
       Global scope so there's no Astro CSS-scoping quirk swallowing
       the background on class names nested deeper in the tree. */
    padding: 96px 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 30%, rgba(255, 107, 43, 0.10), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 80%, rgba(255, 107, 43, 0.06), transparent 60%),
      #0F0F0F;
    border-top: 1px solid #2A2A2A;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2A2A2A;
    color: #E8E8E8;
  }

  .g3d-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .g3d-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-glow);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 43, 0.35);
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .g3d-heading {
    font-family: var(--font);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    /* Explicitly override global section h2 font-size + any inherited
       muted tone.  This needs to POP on the dark bg. */
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .g3d-heading::after {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    width: 72px;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), #f59e42);
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .g3d-lead {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    max-width: 540px;
  }
  .g3d-lead-small { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); }

  .g3d-sub {
    font-size: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .g3d-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .g3d-list li {
    padding: 8px 0 8px 28px;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .g3d-list li::before {
    content: "\2192";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .g3d-list strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

  .g3d-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .g3d-btn-primary { /* inherits .btn */ }
  .g3d-btn-secondary { margin-left: 0; }

  /* ---- Agent-chat mock ---- */

  .g3d-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .g3d-chat {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 540px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 20px;
    box-shadow:
      0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  }

  .g3d-chat-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .g3d-avatar {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #f59e42);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .g3d-chat-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text); }
  .g3d-chat-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px; }

  .g3d-msg {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .g3d-msg-user { justify-content: flex-end; }

  .g3d-bubble {
    max-width: 85%;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .g3d-bubble-user {
    background: var(--accent-glow);
    border-color: rgba(255, 107, 43, 0.35);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .g3d-bubble-text { color: var(--text); }
  .g3d-bubble-result { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; }

  .g3d-toolchips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 10px 0 4px;
  }
  .g3d-chip {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    background: var(--bg-code);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .g3d-chip-win {
    background: rgba(195, 155, 58, 0.12);
    color: #d4b256;
    border-color: rgba(195, 155, 58, 0.3);
  }
  .g3d-chip-sign {
    background: rgba(122, 140, 90, 0.12);
    color: #9cb078;
    border-color: rgba(122, 140, 90, 0.3);
  }

  .g3d-ok { color: #9cb078; font-weight: 700; }
  .g3d-muted { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .g3d-mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.9em; color: var(--text-muted); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .g3d-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .g3d-section { padding: 64px 0; }
  }
</style>
